/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Cobb, Alexander R; Harvey, Charles Franklin (2019): Hydraulic conductivity from the Mendaram peat swamp in Brunei Darussalam [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.908209, 
	In supplement to: Cobb, AR; Harvey, CF (2019): Scalar Simulation and Parameterization of Water Table Dynamics in Tropical Peatlands. Water Resources Research, 55(11), 9351-9377, https://doi.org/10.1029/2019WR025411
Abstract:	The hydraulic conductivity knots are recorded along with their 95% confidence intervals. Details on how they were computed from the peat surface Laplacian and throughfall and water table time series are provided in Cobb and Harvey (2019).
Keyword(s):	hydraulic conductivity; specific yield; throughfall; tropical peat swamp; water table
Further details:	README for Brunei peat swamp data (URI: https://store.pangaea.de/Publications/Cobb-Harvey_2019/README.pdf)
